     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"2\">Hi all, </font><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">I&#39;ve been working with a state file/genind file with my dartseq data so far. I&#39;m trying to use dartR&#39;s nice way of converting it through to a &quot;gds&quot; file for use with SNPRelate. However I seem to get the following error that I am unable to resolve.</font></div><div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">&gt; teretLD &lt;- gi2gl(dps2, parallel = TRUE)</font></div><div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">Error in gi2gl(dps2, parallel = TRUE) :   trying to get slot &quot;loc.n.all&quot; from an object of a basic class (&quot;matrix&quot;) with no slots<br></font></div><div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><div></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><p></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">where &quot;dps2&quot; is my genind file of ~21,000 snps</font></p><p></p></div><br></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Thanks in advance! </div></div>"
    ]
   ]
