     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Hi James,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>I assume you have some funky loci (e.g. all NAs of monomorph in on loci).<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Can you check what you get when typing<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>table(<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">d...@loc.n.all</a>)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>should be only 2s.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">==============================================================================<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Dr Bernd Gruber\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                                            )/_         \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                                                         _.--..---&quot;-,--c_    \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Associate Professor      \r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                          \\|..&#